OL,5, FWhat President Ursula $vonderleyen and
OL,6,FI discussed earlier could become a     
OL,7,Freality and GREATLY help Ukraine, our  
OL,8,Fresilience, and our diplomacy. I thank 
OL,9,Fher and the $EU-Commission for the     
OL,10,Fproposal to establish the Instrument   
OL,11,Ffor Coordinated Support to Ukraine,    
OL,12,Funder which the EU would provide up to 
OL,13,F&euro;45 billion in financial          
OL,14,Fassistance to Ukraine. This will       
OL,15,Fcomplement the EU's existing           
OL,16,Fcommitments under the Ukraine Support  
OL,17,FLoan and will cover a significant part 
OL,18,Fof the budget and defense needs for    
OL,19,Fnext year, 2027. We very much hope for 
OL,20,Fthe swift adoption of this decision by 
OL,21,Fthe European Parliament and the Council
OL,22,Fand count on the support of all EU     
OL,23,Fmember states.                         
OL,24,AInternacional  BBolsa  CTempo  FTV'S   
