OL,3,F(CONTINUACAO)                          
OL,4, FI also thank Ursula for her initiative
OL,5,Fto bring in assistance from our other  
OL,6,Fpartners through new mechanisms to     
OL,7,Ffacilitate and coordinate additional   
OL,8,Fsupport. The UK, Canada, Japan, and    
OL,9,FNorway have been helping tremendously  
OL,10,Fin our defense of life, and            
OL,11,Festablishing clear rules under which   
OL,12,Fthey can provide further aid in        
OL,13,Fconjunction with the EU will help even 
OL,14,Fmore. Tomorrow, we will have a         
OL,15,Fsubstantive discussion at the Coalition
OL,16,Fof the Willing meeting to put all of   
OL,17,Fthis on track as soon as possible.     
OL,18, FThank you to everyone who is helping! 
OL,19,FStrong support for Ukraine is the best 
OL,20,Fsignal to Russia that this war must    
OL,21,Fend.                                   
OL,23, F&mdash; Volodymyr Zelenskyy /         
